        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International GRB, Concealed Screw Rope Mount Grab Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by RK International, the Rope Base Grab Bar is available in 6 sizes ranging from 12 inches to 42 inches. All of them have a 1-1/4 inch diameter except for the 36 inch and the 42 inch lengths which have a 1-1/2 inch diameter tube. It is available in 6 finishes. The rope design along the mounts is a classic, adding a little something extra that makes this pull not only functional, but beautiful.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the RK International Rope Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GRB-1</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GRB-2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GRB-3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 26-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GRB-4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 32-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GRB-5</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 38-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GRB-6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 44-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-10-specifications.gif?v=1704354502\" width=\"428\" height=\"145\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
